

>> usedMemory1 := 0.
>> usedMemory2 := 0.
>> usedMemory3 := 0.
>> usedMemory4 := 0.

Atur-cara pengurusan-ingatan: 0.

>> a := Senarai baharu.
>> b := Senarai ← 1 ; 2.

Atur-cara kemaskan.
usedMemory1 := (Atur-cara ingatan ? 0).


a := Senarai baharu.
b := Senarai ← 1 ; 2.

Atur-cara kemaskan.
